---
source: tests/render.rs
expression: "render_images(\"images.md\", &Capabilities::plain(WIDTH))"
---
# Images

  An image alone in a paragraph is shown at
  its natural size:

  [image: Test pattern]

  A small image is not enlarged:

  [image: Icon]

  A wide image shrinks to the text width:

  [image: Panorama]

  A linked image is shown, but cannot be
  clicked yet:

  [image: Linked icon] <https://example.com>

  - An image in a list:

    [image: Transparent in a list]

  - [image: Alone in a list item]

  > An image in a quote:
  >
  > [image: Quoted panorama]

  In running text, [image: an inline icon]
  stays alt text, and so does [image: an icon]
  with words <https://example.com> in a link.

  ╭─────────────────────┬────────────────────╮
  │ Image               │ Note               │
  ├─────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
  │ [image: Icon in a   │ Alt text in a      │
  │ cell]               │ table              │
  ╰─────────────────────┴────────────────────╯

  A missing file, a file that is no image and
  a remote image show their alt text:

  [image: Missing image]

  [image: Not an image]

  [image: Remote image]
